    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Stack are delighted to bring this detached former schoolhouse to the market. Set on a 0.37 acre site, the property is located within a 5 minute drive to the village of Moyvane and all amenities inc. primary school, shop, hardware store, pubs, church etc. The heritage town of Listowel is a 10 min drive away as is the Tarbert to Killimer car Ferry (gateway to the West) while the N69 coast road provides ease of access to Limerick, Clare and beyond. \n\nWe are advised that water & electricity connections are available on the roadside. As excellent refurbishment project, the property provides an opportunity for any discerning buyer to complete to their own specifications. Notably, having been vacant for over two years, it may qualify for the Vacant Property Refurbishment Grant — subject to eligibility and approval. The property is being sold as seen. \n\nViewing is highly recommended and is strictly by appointment only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>A rare opportunity for those seeking a unique refurbishment project with charm and potential</li><li>Contained in Folio KY9779 - 0.37 acre / 0.15 HA</li><li>Tranquil countryside setting</li><li>Convenient to the villages of Moyvane, Tarbert and the heritage town of Listowel </li><li>Located off the main N69 route: Limerick to Kerry route </li><li>Mature site with trees and hedging and excellent views of the surrounding countryside</ul>"
      },
